{"revision":3,"source":"synthetic:cedar/03-cost-scope-note.md","title":"03-cost-scope-note.md","id":"cedar-3","text":"# Cedar C-21 operating-cost evidence boundary\nDocument status: final companion note to controlled trial C-21.\nSynthetic local evidence only.\nC-21 measured electricity consumption, not monthly operating cost. Site electricity tariffs, maintenance charges, and equipment lease prices were not collected. No operating-cost comparison between Dune and Reed can be computed from the C-21 package.\nThe signed C-21 measurement sheet and approved C-21 acceptance rule are the sources for trial acceptance. This note supplies no replacement temperature or energy readings.\n","version":3,"workspace_id":"5a4d7682-bc57-4d9d-8696-6144a3546b91"}